WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:03.270
Every week, the big grocery chains have one goal.

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:06.480
Getting you to spend more than you planned.

00:00:08.430 --> 00:00:08.996
Red signs.

00:00:08.996 --> 00:00:09.675
Two for one.

00:00:09.675 --> 00:00:11.430
Deals that aren't really deals.

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:14.680
So we're declaring war on the big chains.

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:17.570
Meet Sjekka.

00:00:21.042 --> 00:00:22.042
Add what you need.

00:00:26.108 --> 00:00:29.858
See what your whole list costs in every store, and where it's cheapest.

00:00:35.508 --> 00:00:38.808
Every price comes from real receipts, shared by people like you.

00:00:41.174 --> 00:00:44.090
Every offer is checked against what it cost before the sale.

00:00:44.090 --> 00:00:45.694
So you know which deals are real.

00:00:46.863 --> 00:00:49.163
Snap your receipt, and help everyone pay less.

00:00:54.659 --> 00:00:55.222
Sjekka.

00:00:55.222 --> 00:00:56.509
Stop overpaying.
